      {
        "author_name": "Eric",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116083119696306793281/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7dx1CrI0MSDBxr8NBMZ2cxh5nNEHVhOGJgmq_BhKMsw2YQw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "To date the experience has been very good. An effort was put into verifying that I would be ordering and receiving the product I was looking for. That is great because in this day and age there are a lot of companies out there which don't understand  what customer service actually is. Thanks.",
        "time": 1763572072,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dale Hambly",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103687075933429060784/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlS1XsNp_Dla9LEyMxOfFaRkKc-YRhtndbUroHlToNScAfdT0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I have purchased several times from Tenaquip, great online store.  Received my items quickly and without any issures.  My last order was unfortunately damaged, Tenaquip replaced the damaged product.  Great friendly professional people.  I will definitely be purchasing from them in the future!",
        "time": 1761853382,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Bri Foster",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114180099726480896314/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXj8z5TL2lrGRXvFSHmjom7IHIheMj8SakhvQQHIrXDq5vH00FA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Thank you Tenaquip! I had a rush order and you were able to process it as fast as possible, saving my deadline! A pleasure to do business with you, and I'll certainly be back again. 5 stars! 🏆",
        "time": 1761845745,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Some User",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103610703734804686940/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLWRydvJ3IcVlzcCkZllznC2CnWUzBEIW_nWiYq_xf5oYFgJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Ordered a lawnmower online only to be told that there was a price error so they were canceling the order and issuinga refund.  I usuallywouldn't have a big problem with that except they've held onto the refund amount for almost a week.   Won't trust this site again.",
        "time": 1757699202,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ellie Wright",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103662966377060257904/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTOI8hnTm4uhcpL9D-zoyvm1_GPKicynvMpZhKkR6kBf7N2w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Hands down the worst ordering experience I've had. They sell things that aren't in stock and then it takes months to get if you do get it. I've been fighting directly with their customer service department about where my items are and it's like pulling teeth trying to get help from them. I won't be ordering through Tenaquip anymore.",
        "time": 1767815151,
